  analysisNotes: "Source ado_show_.m4a, decoded duration 189.639833 s, 48000 Hz stereo.
    Time zero is file start. Measured spectral flux / RMS / band energy, not title/version
    metadata. Onset resolution 10 ms; allow about \xB125 ms perceptual adjustment.
    No long leading silence. Playback WAV uses fixed 18x gain (25.105 dB), no trimming/stretching/compression.
    First grand burst 66.1813 s; last accent 188.0213 s. Near-silent tail about 188.24
    s to file end. Blue only at 173.9113, 177.5913, 181.1413 s. Three short attacks
    at 18.9113, 19.1413, 19.3413 s. All launch times are derived from the editable
    anchor and rise time. Parade revision: 130 cues, 9 prefab types. Measured main
    cue anchors preserved; multibreak child flashes use an explicit relative delay.
    No extra blue outside the finale. Wide/natural revision: 163 cues, 13 types;
    21 low-intensity calm cues and 12 outer-sky accents. Pattern shells use jittered
    ignition, individual drag/burnout and broken short trails. Main source-file anchors
    unchanged."
